Pinned Brightness source fixture
===============================

Repository: https://github.com/cosmic-utils/cosmic-ext-applet-external-monitor-brightness
Commit: 3e6486ff11dba8cdb729420c27b4ce2c519f8443
Files: src/app.rs, src/monitor.rs, src/main.rs
License: GPL-3.0-only, preserved in pinned-brightness.LICENSE.

pinned-brightness-sources.json.gz holds exact original Git HEAD bytes as JSON
strings for transform/refusal/real-patch source tests. These files are not
relicensed by the repository's MIT license. The managed-popup postimage is
computed separately before the narrowly guarded grouped-command transform.
brightness_commands.rs is original Studio code integrated under GPL-3.0-only.

The fixture does not prove full application compilation, DDC/monitor support,
Flatpak baseline/sandbox compatibility, or native desktop rendering. The
original watch channel remains last-value-only across distinct UI actions.
